{{wowapitype}}
These are unique IDs for zone maps and can be returned from <code>{{api|C_Map.GetBestMapForUnit}}("player")</code> for the current zone or <code>WorldMapFrame:GetMapID()</code> for the currently viewed map. They can be passed to {{api|C_Map.GetMapInfo}}() or <code>WorldMapFrame:SetMapID()</code>. The values are defined in {{dbc|UiMap}}
* See [[InstanceID]] for identifying map instances instead of UI maps.
* In [[Patch 8.0.1/API changes|Patch 8.0.1]] the map API was updated, replacing [[WorldMapAreaID]] and ''DungeonMapID'' with ''UiMapID''.
